Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in inline LOOKUP and GETATTR dispatch

Bypass the worker wakeup for path validation; retain zero-timeout cache
policy and asynchronous I/O and locks. Disabled by default because a slow
host metadata operation can delay the event loop.

